{"version":1,"content":"<p>無綫台慶劇《璀璨之城》在昨晚（2日）播出的一集，在劇中飾演官家大小姐的蔣家旻有破格演出，她除了背住老公周志康與黃子恆偷食外，二人更上演一幕鴛鴦浴戲。</p><p>蔣家旻在鏡頭前除去浴衣，露出背裸玉背兼修長美腿，又再一次挑戰尺度。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&amp;l</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T07:42:59.918774+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T07:00:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T07:38:17.449958+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T07:38:17.449958+00:00","content_hash":"cbc4ec8eff12a772808c63e15528df4e7506a15a1583b0958e163f35bb1744b9","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}